# = is the light assignment of a declaration; it never changes a variable
** spec: syntax/declarations.md#variables-and-constants
primary aspect a46_light_assignment is
  process main is
    new x = 1 :Integer;
    let x = 2;                   ** compile error: a change uses :=
  return;
end a46_light_assignment;
